### 상품 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### 상품 목록 조회 - 페이지네이션
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?offset=0&limit=40

### 상품 검색
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?keyword=브러쉬

### 상품 최신순
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?orderBy=recent

### 상품 상세 조회
@productId = 6a3ca9b8a897c7cca0b919d4
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}

### 상품 수정 (id)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/6a3ca9b8a897c7cca0b919d4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 18000,
  "name": "메이크업 브러쉬"
}

### 상품 삭제 (id)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/6a3ca9b8a897c7cca0b919d4

### 에러 처리
GET http://localhost:3000/products/abc